OL,3,GNEWSAFormer teacher jailed for sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former teacher has been jailed after
OL,7,Fadmitting a series of sexual offences
OL,8,Fagainst a child.
OL,10,FAshley Morgans, 57, formerly of
OL,11,FWoodland Way, Gunnislake, Cornwall,
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to the attempted rape of
OL,13,Fa girl under the age of 16 while
OL,14,Fworking in the county.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
