OL,3,GNEWSAFormer teacher jailed for sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also pleaded guilty to engaging in
OL,7,Fnon-penetrative sexual activity with a
OL,8,Fgirl aged between 13 and 15, as well as
OL,9,Fpenetrative sexual activity with a girl
OL,10,Faged between 13 and 15. Devon and
OL,11,FCornwall Police said the offences,
OL,12,Fagainst the same victim, took place
OL,13,Fduring the 2000s over a number of
OL,14,Fyears.
OL,16,FAt Truro Crown Court on 12 November,
OL,17,FMorgans was sentenced to nine years
OL,18,Fimprisonment and was put on the sex
OL,19,Foffenders register indefinitely.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
